body:
Adds support for variables in the config, so that they can be passed to the command in the following format:

```json
  {
    "name": "Stripe",

    "config": {
      "mcpKey": "stripe",
      "runtime": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@stripe/mcp",
        "--tools=all",
        "--api-key=${STRIPE_API_KEY}"
      ]
    },
    "setup": [
      {
        "label": "Get an API Key",
        "value": "You can find your Stripe API key in the Stripe Dashboard under Developers > API keys.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "label": "Stripe API Key",
        "type": "input",
        "placeholder": "Enter your Stripe API key",
        "value": "Enter your Stripe API key",
        "key": "STRIPE_API_KEY"
      }
    ]
```
